<item><title>Magwi access roads ease farmers’ route from fields to markets</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/magwi-access-roads-ease-farmers-route-from-fields-to-markets-0c0d21/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/magwi-access-roads-ease-farmers-route-from-fields-to-markets-0c0d21/</guid><category>South Sudan</category><description>Residents say a community road linking farming areas to the main route is helping vehicles carry produce without getting stuck.</description><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 06:46:22 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/magwi-access-roads-ease-farmers-route-from-fields-to-markets-0c0d21/share.jpg" length="42701" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ss/magwi-access-roads-ease-farmers-route-from-fields-to-markets-0c0d21/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
